    Network player page, rebuilt for the OWW221 panel (378x496 px = 189x248 dp).

    The master layout was authored for a phone: 50/58 dp transport buttons filled
    the entire 189 dp width, the artist line had to carry the whole quality
    string at 8 sp, and there was no elapsed/total readout at all. This version
    keeps every id, tag and view type the generated DataBinding mapping needs and
    only changes geometry and styling:

      * one scrim so text stays legible over the cover;
      * a dedicated quality line instead of overloading @id/artist;
      * a time row above the seek bar;
      * transport buttons sized for a 189 dp wide screen.

    The constraint graph is a top-anchored block plus a bottom-anchored block
    with the transport row floating between them, so it resolves in one pass.
-->
